Executar: docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml up --build
Entrar no terminal do container: docker compose exec <nome do servi ce> bash
Sair: exit

Instalar: curl -fsSL https://opencode.ai/install | bash
procurar opencode; find / -name opencode 2>/dev/null
RODAR OPENCODE: /root/.opencode/bin/opencode

RESET terminal: reset

Derrubar todos os containers:

docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml down -v
docker compose -f docker-compose.dev.yml down -v --remove-orphans
docker volume prune -f